# nbkit: terminal texts in English. Same keys as pt-BR.lang (the reference file).
# Format: key=value. The value is a printf format: %s is replaced by the values, \n breaks the line and %% becomes %.
# {B} bold, {D} dim, {N} normal, {G} green, {Y} yellow, {R} red, {BL} blue.

